      "content": "Instead of focusing on risks, emphasize the inherent strength and proven remedial pathways of the site. Frame the upper strata as \"variable fill material requiring standard, best-in-class foundation engineering practices\" to achieve optimal load transfer to the competent bedrock. This frames the work as a manageable, professional requirement rather than a fundamental geological problem. By highlighting the rigorous engineering solutions, you showcase competence and control over the entire development process.",
